Description: Z39.50 client for JAVA
 YAZ4J is a client-side Z39.50/SRU/Solr library for information
 retrieval. It is based on the ZOOM API of YAZ.
 .
 yaz4j calls YAZ directly using the Java Foreign Function and Memory
 API and requires a 64-bit Java 22 or later.

